{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Apple 在 iOS 27.3 Beta 中將單手模式擴展至 <a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/tag/iPhone-Duo\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">iPhone Duo</a>，讓用戶在合上機身時把外螢幕內容向左或向右移位，以便拇指觸及。</p>\n<h2>外螢幕內容左右移位</h2>\n<p>當 iPhone Duo 合上時，在左邊緣短距離向左滑動，或在右邊緣短距離向右滑動，即可將外螢幕內容向左或向右移動。</p>\n<p>單手模式可經「設定 ＞ 輔助使用 ＞ 觸控 ＞ 單手模式」開啟或關閉，更新至新軟件後預設為開啟。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"與 iPhone Duo 相關的圖片\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/duo-3.webp\" width=\"1920\"/></figure>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T20:01:13.991935+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":192,"images":1,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T19:50:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T23:38:24.511625+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T19:58:35.832277+00:00","content_hash":"16655d099f0f52855767aed07c3829df18bc79de3166a4dbb3533d7e754d4017","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}